# Docker architecture (LuminaryWorks)

- Local run: only images matching the host CPU. On Apple Silicon, never run amd64/x86 (including qemu/Rosetta).
- Image choice: prefer multi-arch tags (arm64 + amd64). Do not pin `platform: linux/amd64` for local convenience.
- Publish: buildx multi-platform when artifacts may run on Mac or x86 servers.
- Canonical: `LuminaryWorks/docs/DOCKER.md` (or this product copy / AGENTS.md section).

